# Build-time variables for `vite build`. Committed on purpose: the Turnstile
# SITE key is public by design — it is embedded in every page's HTML — and
# Turnstile binds it to hornetdrones.com, so it is useless anywhere else.
#
# The SECRET key must never appear in this file, in any VITE_ variable, or
# anywhere in the repo. It lives only in the Pages dashboard as a Secret.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAE3Dz9Bc8YUeFmrv
